# The camera's flight down into the cycle once the loop's broken (game/arrival_flight.h): from the
# stands up to an overview of the arena as its walls rise out of the floor, and down behind the
# cycle into 1st person, in 3 s. The cycle starts at the arena's centre, facing north, wherever
# the message had got to. Shots every ~0.25 s through it, then play.
wait_boot # the opening flight is up
# Hurry it to x3: it lands in about 3 s
press b
wait 3.5
wait 2
press left
wait 0.6
press left
wait 0.6
press left
shot arrive_00
wait 0.12
shot arrive_01
wait 0.12
shot arrive_02
wait 0.12
shot arrive_03
wait 0.12
shot arrive_04
wait 0.12
shot arrive_05
wait 0.12
shot arrive_06
wait 0.12
shot arrive_07
wait 0.12
shot arrive_08
wait 0.12
shot arrive_09
wait 0.12
shot arrive_10
wait 0.12
shot arrive_11
wait 0.5
shot arrive_landed
wait 1.5
shot arrive_riding
